==English==

==={{acronym-old|en}}===
'''FYROM'''

# The [[former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia]]

====Usage notes====

Although the word "former" is intentionally not capitalized, as it is a "provisional designator", not the title for the state, the acronym "FYROM" is often used.

